## How to test? (optional)

### Templates
1. Open any field-plugin template
2. Define the manifest object inside `field-plugin.config.ts`.
4. E.g.:
```
{
  "options": [
    {
      "name": "multiple",
      "value": {
        "hello": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "next",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "boolean",
      "value": true
    },
    {}
  ]
}

```

### Deploy Command
1. Open any field-plugin template (e.g.:react) 
3. Temporarily add `@storyblok/field-plugin-cli: workspace:*` and install
4. Change deploy command to  `deploy": "npm run build && npx @storyblok/field-plugin-cli deploy`
5. Run `yarn dev` while playing around with the `field-plugin.config.json`
6. Observe when the options are uploaded and errors displayed in the console.

